flowchart TB
accTitle: Buffer a brief write burst
accDescr: Producers durably enqueue records while controlled workers drain the backlog into DynamoDB. Messages are removed only after successful writes.
P[Bursty record arrivals]:::inputData --> Q[(SQS backlog)]:::storage
Q --> W[Workers with bounded concurrency]:::process
W --> D[(DynamoDB table)]:::storage
D --> R{Write succeeded?}:::decision
R -->|Yes| A[Delete SQS message]:::output
R -->|Transient failure| B[Backoff and retry]:::warning
B --> W
N[Average drain rate must exceed average arrivals]:::reference -.-> Q
